<title>HONG KONG: Air HK adds freight service to Osaka.</title>
<headline>Air HK adds freight service to Osaka.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>AHK Air Hong Kong Ltd, the air cargo service unit of Cathay Pacific Airways, said on Tuesday it would add a third weekly freight service between Hong Kong and the Japanese city of Osaka.</p>
<p>Air Hong Kong said in a statement the new service, which is to start on April 4, was added due to strong demand.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
